1
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:04,070
Get ready to turn your
brains to viewing mode

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,600
because, previously
on "Final Space,"

3
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:06,870
Gary just received
a Mayday call

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,540
for none other than Quinn,
the super-spicy captain

5
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:12,510
he hasn't stopped thinking
about for the past five years.

6
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,380
What a loser!
Ha ha ha!

7
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:16,710
Oh, and Quinn is on the run
from the Infinity Guard?

8
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:21,680
Whoa! We've had our fun.
Get ready to have yours.

9
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:27,120
♪♪

10
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,490
H.U.E.: Gary, you have
six minutes

11
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,060
