12
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,130
Gary: It can't be.

13
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,800
What are you doing, Gary?

14
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,730
What do you think I'm doing?
I'm gonna consume its power.

15
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:41,440
But opening your helmet
will blow out your internals,

16
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:43,370
