instantaneous death.

17
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,210
That's one
possible outcome.

18
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,710
Another, I eat the cookie,
and its power turns me

19
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,750
into a majestic
space-breathing manticore.

20
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:52,320
You will die before
you eat the cookie.

21
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:55,180
I'm pretty sure I could get it
in there before I die.

22
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:58,350
-That is not possible, Gary.
-I really think I can do it.

23
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:01,560
I'm gonna lob it right in
and close the helmet super fast.

24
00:01:01,590 --> 00:01:02,530
You can't, Gary.

25
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:06,630
No lobbing,
no closing, no cookie.

26
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:09,700
[ Sighs ]

27
00:01:09,730 --> 00:01:19,740
♪♪

28
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:29,750
♪♪

29
00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:35,720
♪♪

30
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:41,630
♪♪

31
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:43,530
Quinn: Mayday, Mayday!

32
00:01:43,570 --> 00:01:46,140
My name is Quinn Airgone,
a captain in the Infinity Guard.

33
00:01:46,170 --> 00:01:48,300
I've been investigating
a gravitational disturbance,

34
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:50,440
