is a breach in space.

35
00:01:50,470 --> 00:01:55,440
Many people are dead, and I'm
about to join them unless...

36
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:59,580
Aah! Is there not a single idiot
that can hear me?!

37
00:01:59,620 --> 00:02:03,150
I can hear her.

38
00:02:03,190 --> 00:02:05,920
The greatest love story
in the history of the universe

39
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:07,620
is about to blossom forth.

40
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:10,460
Yo, dude, just keep
the expectations in check.

41
00:02:10,490 --> 00:02:12,630
Quinn hasn't responded
to a single message of yours

42
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:13,830
