43
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:15,830
People get busy.
I'm busy.

44
00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:16,930
For five years?

45
00:02:16,970 --> 00:02:20,170
4 years, 11 months
and 30 days.

46
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:22,310
-That's five years, bro.
-Maybe it is. Maybe it isn't.

47
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:24,410
-It is.
-But it could not be.

48
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,940
H.U.E.: Disabled transporter
is now locked in.

49
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:29,380
Dispatching Sames
to secure Quinn.

50
00:02:29,410 --> 00:02:30,850
Over my hard nipples,
H.U.E.!

51
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:33,320
If anyone is saving Quinn,
it's me, the captain.

52
00:02:33,350 --> 00:02:37,350
Gary, for what is
the 9,045th time,

53
00:02:37,390 --> 00:02:39,490
you are still a prisoner.
-I disagree.

54
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,890
As soon as the crap
hit the interstellar fan,

55
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,660
I became the captain
for real.

56
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:45,330
Calculating, no.

57
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,760
Calculating, yes.

58
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:49,830
I will use those powers
to rescue Quinn.

59
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:52,340
One week has been added
to your sentence.

60
00:02:52,370 --> 00:02:53,970
Frickin' what -- what --
w-- what's new, H.U.E.?

61
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,670
What's new?

62
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:57,840
Now, before I risk my life
for the woman I love,

63
00:02:57,870 --> 00:02:59,840
does anyone perchance
have a breath mint?

64
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,410
-Right here, Gary.
-Ach! Oh!

65
00:03:02,450 --> 00:03:04,350
God, no, I'm killing
my best friend!

66
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:06,280
Let KVN get it.
I can do it.

67
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:08,220
I'm close.
It's right there.

68
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:11,590
Whoa, KVN, stay away,
far away from me forever!

69
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:13,720
Oh, my God! Ugh!

70
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:19,460
♪♪

71
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:21,860
Aah!

72
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:26,570
♪♪

73
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:29,810
[ Beeping ]

74
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:32,840
Gary: Commencing rescue.
Commencing destiny.

75
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:42,720
♪♪

76
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:53,560
♪♪

77
00:03:53,600 --> 00:04:03,570
♪♪

78
00:04:03,610 --> 00:04:13,480
♪♪

79
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,320
