87
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:34,300
No, seriously, I have
no idea who you are.

88
00:04:34,340 --> 00:04:35,700
Really?

89
00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:37,910
You resemble no one
I know, so, yeah, really.

90
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:39,540
