-Seriously.

91
00:04:39,580 --> 00:04:41,540
Oh, dear Lord, you're
suffering from amnesia!

92
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:43,950
I'm suffering
from an emergency

93
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:46,480
that's going
to destroy Earth.

94
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,920
[ Laughs ] Quinn, you really
expect me to believe

95
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:50,090
you don't know who I am?

96
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:52,560
Hold on.
I know how to fix this.

97
00:04:52,590 --> 00:04:56,790
[ Smacks lips ]
This is the real raw Gary.

98
00:04:56,830 --> 00:04:58,930
[ Laughs ] That didn't fix it,
whoever you are.

99
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,960
What a dagger
to the heart.

100
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,370
I'm the guy who,
for the past five years,

101
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,800
