daily documentaries

102
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:08,640
to the woman
who has no idea who I am!

103
00:05:08,670 --> 00:05:11,710
Wow, that sucks.
I never got any of them.

104
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:14,340
Now, if you could just show me
where the bridge is...

105
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:17,410
It's all good.
Life, you know?

106
00:05:17,450 --> 00:05:21,950
Hmm, cute guy, but issues,
definite issues.

107
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:23,750
[ Crying ]

108
00:05:23,790 --> 00:05:25,850
Quinn doesn't
even know who I am!

109
00:05:25,890 --> 00:05:28,590
Oh, no! Oh!

110
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:30,730
Oh! Uh!

111
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:35,130
Oh, this is not what
it's supposed to be.

112
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:38,130
Oh, God, it hurts so much!

113
00:05:38,170 --> 00:05:41,570
Oh, she doesn't
even know who I am!

114
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:44,010
I need to record my feelings!

115
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,740
Quinn, for future reference,

116
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:48,080
