built on honesty.

122
00:05:55,850 --> 00:05:57,620
You can't, can you?

123
00:05:57,650 --> 00:05:59,590
That's because there aren't any.

124
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,630
I know this doesn't
make any sense,

125
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,830
but I really needed to talk
to somebody right now,

126
00:06:05,860 --> 00:06:07,760
and you're the only person
I can open my heart wallet to

127
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,700
and spend
my hurt coins with.

128
00:06:09,730 --> 00:06:12,000
-Jerry?
-Oh! Jerry?

129
00:06:12,030 --> 00:06:15,000
You don't even
know my name.

130
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,070
Avocato,
is he all right?

131
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:18,570
-No.
-You know Avocato's name?

132
00:06:18,610 --> 00:06:21,780
-Hey, gang.
-Not now, KVN.

133
00:06:21,810 --> 00:06:23,580
Carl, Hank,
Orson, Noodles,

134
00:06:23,610 --> 00:06:25,180
can you give me
and, uh...

135
00:06:25,210 --> 00:06:27,820
-Gary.
-...Gary a minute?

136
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:30,890
Who are you
recording that for?

137
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,920
Someone who meant
quite a lot to me.

138
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,720
I hope she gets
to see it one day.

139
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,060
When you're this
far out in space,

140
00:06:36,090 --> 00:06:38,790
most of that stuff
gets lost.

141
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,130
Suppose it does.

142
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,960
What did you
come here for?

143
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:45,200
I just wanted to say,
"Thank you, Gerald."

144
00:06:45,230 --> 00:06:46,600
You're welcome.

145
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,100
Gerald?
Is his name Gerald?

146
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:50,070
Was he lying to us
this whole time?

147
00:06:50,110 --> 00:06:52,640
I'm confused.
Maybe Gerald is a nickname.

148
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,080
Maybe his last name
is Gerald.

149
00:06:54,110 --> 00:06:57,510
Help me to understand,
Gerald, Gary, Gerald.

150
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:06,220
SAMES:
This ship has been seized

151
00:07:06,250 --> 00:07:08,920
by the authority
of the Infinity Guard.

152
00:07:13,530 --> 00:07:16,570
Carl, not right now.
I've had a bad day.

153
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,570
I am really not in the mood
for a hug, Carl.

154
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:21,070
Carl, that's enough.
I'm fine. Get away from me!

155
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:23,070
Bad Carl! Bad Carl!

156
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:25,470
Bad Carl!

157
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:26,880
H.U.E. Emergency.

158
00:07:26,910 --> 00:07:29,210
Our power reactor
has been drained.

159
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:32,150
The Galaxy I is immobilized.

160
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:39,120
A takeover command has been
uploaded into my system.

161
00:07:39,150 --> 00:07:41,760
I am fighting it,
but it will succeed.

162
00:07:41,790 --> 00:07:43,630
Okay. Uh.

163
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:45,690
It's the Infinity Guard.
We've been hacked.

164
00:07:45,730 --> 00:07:47,200
For some reason,
they're trying

165
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:48,900
