my investigation.

166
00:07:48,930 --> 00:07:50,970
-What a bunch of nerds.
-They're after me.

167
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,670
-You? Why? You're perfect.
-Where do I start?

168
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:55,070
The Earth is being sucked
into a black hole.

169
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:57,140
I went rogue, stole a ship,
evaded arrest,

170
00:07:57,170 --> 00:07:59,740
