this ship, everyone dies.

171
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:01,140
You sly fox.

172
00:08:01,180 --> 00:08:03,550
Hey! Oh, my gosh.
Okay.

173
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:06,650
Sorry, sorry.
I meant, "You icy minx."

174
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:09,180
Oh, I'm bleeding!
I'm bleeding.

175
00:08:09,220 --> 00:08:12,720
Sorry, I meant,
"Danger panda."

176
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:13,990
Oh! We're flirting!

177
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:16,020
We're flirting!
This is great!

178
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:18,760
This is a good advancement
in our relationship!

179
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:20,900
Oh! Oh, my gosh! Okay.
Okay. We're done flirting.

180
00:08:20,930 --> 00:08:24,200
We're not flirting,
just like old times.

181
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:26,030
Trust me.
This is just the start.

182
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:28,870
An Imperium cruiser will be
on the way to seize the ship.

183
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:31,040
Well, welcome aboard.
Like we needed more danger.

184
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:33,880
Now we're just stuck here until
the Infinity Guard captures us.

185
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:36,550
How do we get this choo-choo
train back to Safetytown?

186
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:38,910
Theoretically, we could
harness the solar rays

187
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:41,750
