the reactor core.

192
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:50,060
-I'll do it.
-I'll do it.

193
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:53,000
I'll save you again.
-[ Laughs ]

194
00:08:53,030 --> 00:08:54,860
No way.
-Yes way.

195
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:56,160
-You? No, no, no, me.
-Me! No, not...

196
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,900
-No, me.
-I -- I will do it.

197
00:08:57,930 --> 00:09:00,770
Then you will know
who Gary Goodspeed is.

198
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:03,240
Don't worry.
I do this all the...

199
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,810
ti-i-i-i-i-me.

200
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,240
He does do that all the time.

201
00:09:10,150 --> 00:09:11,880
I'm gonna save the ship.
I'm gonna save Quinn.

202
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:14,050
I'm gonna harness
the crap out of destiny.

203
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:14,880
Mooncake, let's do this!

204
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:17,720
Chuck, chuck, chuck,
chuck, woo-hoo!

205
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:23,330
Play the good stuff, H.U.E.

206
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,360
You're a go
for thrusters.

207
00:09:25,390 --> 00:09:31,970
♪♪

208
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,370
♪ Spend a year
out in the desert ♪

209
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,740
♪ Spend a year out to sea

210
00:09:36,770 --> 00:09:39,740
♪ Spend the nights
under the stars ♪

211
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:41,640
♪ Just been asleep

212
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,380
♪ Asked a question...
-What is that?!

213
00:09:43,410 --> 00:09:44,780
♪ ...where I've been

214
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,820
The star is surrounded

215
00:09:49,850 --> 00:09:51,750
