of destroyed vessels.

216
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:53,760
Thank you
for the heads-up, H.U.E.

217
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:55,020
What you are seeing,
Gary,

218
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,760
