of the Scarlet Lance

219
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:57,990
and its fleet.

220
00:09:58,030 --> 00:10:00,660
Thousands of souls
were lost.

221
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:02,770
And it's messy.
We got that part, H.U.E.

222
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,400
It's a mess all over here.

223
00:10:04,430 --> 00:10:06,840
There, over there, right here,

224
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:10,240
especially right here,
everywhere, it's a mess.

225
00:10:10,270 --> 00:10:11,970
Mooncake: Jokahee.

226
00:10:12,010 --> 00:10:13,280
Hurry, Gary.

227
00:10:13,310 --> 00:10:15,680
The star
is about to implode.

228
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:19,680
♪ Go on down

229
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:22,420
We're cooking, H.U.E.

230
00:10:22,450 --> 00:10:26,150
♪♪

231
00:10:26,190 --> 00:10:28,260
Power
is being received.

232
00:10:28,290 --> 00:10:30,130
The Sames
are cutting through.

233
00:10:32,290 --> 00:10:34,160
H.U.E. system is overrun.

234
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:37,200
You are all now prisoners
of the Infinity Guard.

235
00:10:37,230 --> 00:10:41,040
An Imperium will be here
shortly to seize you.

236
00:10:41,070 --> 00:10:42,840
I'm sorry.

237
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:52,680
