239
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:57,690
Not much, you know,
mostly being imprisoned.

240
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,090
You look like crap.
-Shut up!

241
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,920
You always look like crap,
but right now, like,

242
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:06,360
you look like if crap
built a house on crap.

243
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:08,700
Shut up!
Shut up! Shut up!

244
00:11:12,170 --> 00:11:14,000
Ah, come on!

245
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:17,240
[ Laughs evilly ]
Enjoy.

246
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:24,780
