247
00:11:24,810 --> 00:11:26,950
H.U.E.: Sames,
apprehend the targets.

248
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:29,720
Use all force necessary.

249
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:35,190
It is only a matter of time
before we break in.

250
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:37,860
Surrender now.

251
00:11:40,830 --> 00:11:42,200
If we can get into
H.U.E.'s mainframe,

252
00:11:42,230 --> 00:11:43,870
we can regain
control of the ship.

253
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:47,240
Ugh, the Sames are
blocking our way out.

254
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:48,440
That's our way out.

255
00:11:48,470 --> 00:11:51,110
Hey, guys,
I can disable H.U.E.

256
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:54,040
We need to send the best
person for the job.

257
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,110
I accept.

258
00:11:55,140 --> 00:11:57,310
I have a key
in my butthole.

259
00:11:57,350 --> 00:11:58,810
I was thinking of me.

260
00:11:58,850 --> 00:12:00,420
That's funny because
I was thinking of me.

261
00:12:00,450 --> 00:12:03,750
I can do it.
Embrace the KVN.

262
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:05,290
You're not even part
of the Infinity Guard.

263
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:07,260
You're the reason
we're even in this mess,

264
00:12:07,290 --> 00:12:09,890
and I'm the reason
we're going to get out of it.

265
00:12:09,930 --> 00:12:14,300
Got that, baby?
-Don't call me baby.

266
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:16,400
Wish me luck, guys.

267
00:12:16,430 --> 00:12:18,370
-KVN! KVN!
-KVN! KVN!

268
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,900
[ Chanting "KVN!" ]

269
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:32,280
♪♪

270
00:12:32,310 --> 00:12:34,550
Captain's log 5397 --

271
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:36,920
We have found
a life-form small in size.

272
00:12:36,950 --> 00:12:38,090
The doctors tell me

273
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,820
it's unlike anything
they have ever seen.

274
00:12:39,860 --> 00:12:42,360
We're calling it E351.

275
00:12:42,390 --> 00:12:44,830
-Captain, we're being hailed.
-Link it through.

276
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:46,260
Lord Commander: Hello.

277
00:12:46,290 --> 00:12:49,330
You found something
I have been searching for.

278
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:51,000
Hand it over!

279
00:12:51,030 --> 00:12:52,530
Man: Captain, they're
logging onto our fleet.

280
00:12:52,570 --> 00:12:54,240
Prepare
the lightfold engines!

281
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:55,570
Sir, they're firing!

282
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,440
Evasive...

283
00:12:57,470 --> 00:13:00,980
Gah!

284
00:13:01,010 --> 00:13:06,110
♪♪

285
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:07,320
Chocli?

286
00:13:07,350 --> 00:13:09,580
Wherever you go,
death follows,

287
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:12,190
and it will make
its way to Gary.

288
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,160
[ Whimpers ]

289
00:13:14,190 --> 00:13:16,420
It's getting pretty
hot out here, H.U.E.

290
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:17,590
H.U.E.!

291
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:20,430
H.U.E.?
Can you hear me?

292
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:23,500
H.U.E.?
Avocato?

293
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:25,200
Quinn?

294
00:13:25,230 --> 00:13:28,000
Anybody?!

295
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:30,070
KVN?

296
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,040
All right.

297
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,380
Time to head back
before this star implodes.

298
00:13:38,410 --> 00:13:41,320
Where's Mooncake?
Mooncake!

299
00:13:41,350 --> 00:13:43,950
Man #2: Gary.

300
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:49,190
Why is there
a caterpillar out here?

301
00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:50,990
What brings you, noble creature,
so close to my face?

302
00:13:51,030 --> 00:13:53,200
Wait. Why am I talking
to a caterpillar?

303
00:13:53,230 --> 00:13:56,160
It's obvious.
I'm hallucinating.

304
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:59,030
Aah!

305
00:13:59,070 --> 00:14:00,300
Huh!

306
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:07,340
♪♪

307
00:14:07,380 --> 00:14:08,510
How's my boy doing?

308
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:10,880
-Great.
-Dad?

309
00:14:14,450 --> 00:14:15,350
That's unsettling.

310
00:14:15,380 --> 00:14:17,950
Woman:
The new Imperium T-3 Cruiser

311
00:14:17,990 --> 00:14:19,920
will bridge us
to the next galaxy,

312
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:22,290
and the countdown
has begun. 10...

313
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,890
Hey, you want to watch
the launch outside?

314
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:27,030
-...9...
-You bet!

315
00:14:27,060 --> 00:14:30,030
...7, 6, 5...

316
00:14:30,070 --> 00:14:32,030
-Dad!
-Keep your eyes open.

317
00:14:32,070 --> 00:14:34,400
It'll be taking off
right over there.

318
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,640
...3, 2, 1.

319
00:14:38,970 --> 00:14:42,110
-One day, I'm gonna do that.
-You are, huh?

320
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:45,210
Yeah, I'm gonna have
a whole bunch of adventures.

321
00:14:45,250 --> 00:14:48,920
-A whole bunch?
-Bunches and bunches.

322
00:14:48,950 --> 00:14:50,990
Why are you
showing this to me?

323
00:14:51,020 --> 00:14:53,220
Answer me,
you drug-dealer caterpillar!

324
00:14:53,260 --> 00:14:56,220
Ohhhh!

325
00:14:56,260 --> 00:14:59,060
I remember this.

326
00:15:01,730 --> 00:15:04,170
-Son...
-I could come with you.

327
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,570
There's nothing more in the
world that I would want,

328
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:08,600
but not this time,
little buddy.

329
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:10,610
I have to do this
one alone.

330
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,170
You won't understand,

331
00:15:12,210 --> 00:15:14,710
but know that I'm doing
this for you.

332
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:16,410
Can you make me a promise?
-Yeah.

333
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:19,180
Promise me you'll have
your own adventures.

334
00:15:19,210 --> 00:15:20,450
I will.

335
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,120
Bunches and bunches.

336
00:15:23,150 --> 00:15:27,020
Here, this fellow will look
after you while I'm gone.

337
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:28,420
What's his name?

338
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:30,260
Mooncake.

339
00:15:30,290 --> 00:15:34,430
♪♪

340
00:15:34,460 --> 00:15:37,270
[ Beeping ]

341
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:43,710
H.U.E.: KVN, I know what
you're trying to do, KVN.

342
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:46,470
Every attempt to disable me
will fail

343
00:15:46,510 --> 00:15:48,480
because you are a loser.

344
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:49,340
Can't talk, H.U.E.

345
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:53,080
I have to insert
this thingy in you.

346
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:54,480
Huh!

347
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:57,120
I will not let
that insertion happen.

348
00:15:57,150 --> 00:16:00,990
This is your last chance
to cease all action.

349
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:06,130
Stop.

350
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:07,130
Ugh!

351
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:08,660
No one believes in you.

352
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:12,130
Go back,
you waste of life.

353
00:16:12,170 --> 00:16:14,500
Quinn: Hurry, KVN!

354
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:24,710
♪♪

355
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:28,550
♪♪

356
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:31,150
[ Grunting ]

357
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:40,460
Oh, ah, ooh.

358
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:42,360
[ Grunts ]

359
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:50,810
♪♪

360
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,770
Booting back up.

361
00:16:52,810 --> 00:16:57,350
All systems now independent
of the Infinity Guard network.

362
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:59,480
Aah!

363
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:01,750
Aah!

364
00:17:01,780 --> 00:17:04,120
KVN is victorious!

365
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:09,290
KVN did it!
Good job, KVN.

366
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:11,260
Gary is never going
to believe this.

367
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:17,770
Systems have been reactivated.
Hello.

368
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:18,830
Nice to have
you back, H.U.E.

369
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:20,370
Nice to be back.

370
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:22,470
Sorry to be the bearer
of bad news,

371
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:24,570
but we're still
in extreme danger.

372
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:27,440
Those dickheads from
the Infinity Guard found us,

373
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:30,850
and Gary is not responding.

374
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,710
Gary, where are you?

375
00:17:32,750 --> 00:17:35,650
Your radiation levels
are becoming critical.

376
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,420
You must leave now.

377
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:40,620
[ Beeping ]

378
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:42,660
Woman: John Goodspeed
is on a mission

379
00:17:42,690 --> 00:17:45,460
to investigate a shift
in the gravitational constant

380
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:48,200
that's creating
an anomaly in space.

381
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:53,400
Don't make me watch this.

382
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,540
You have to.

383
00:17:55,570 --> 00:18:02,280
♪♪

384
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:04,110
Dad!

385
00:18:04,150 --> 00:18:13,760
♪♪

386
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:19,530
♪♪

387
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:22,360
[ Sizzling ]

388
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:27,900
♪♪

389
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:30,340
H.U.E.: Warning, warning,

390
00:18:30,370 --> 00:18:33,740
radiation levels
have reached 92%.

391
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:35,380
Chookit, pah, pah.

392
00:18:35,410 --> 00:18:37,650
Gary, return to
the ship immediately.

393
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:40,380
I am detecting massive
fluctuations in the star.

394
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:42,220
H.U.E., prime
the lightfold engines.

395
00:18:42,250 --> 00:18:43,650
-What about Gary?
-We don't have the time.

396
00:18:43,690 --> 00:18:44,920
If the Infinity
Guard catches me,

397
00:18:44,950 --> 00:18:46,320
billions of people die.

398
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:47,620
I like Jerry.
-Gary!

399
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:49,520
Right, Gary. I don't
want to leave him,

400
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,560
but this is bigger
than one person.

401
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:55,660
Radiation levels
have now reached 98%.

402
00:18:55,700 --> 00:18:57,300
Wake up, Gary.

403
00:18:57,330 --> 00:18:59,800
The star could explode
at any moment.

404
00:18:59,830 --> 00:19:02,340
Gary, we need you to get
back to the ship now!

405
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:05,340
Gary, the star
is going supernova.

406
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:12,410
Gary, wake the hell up, man.
Get back to the ship pronto.

407
00:19:12,450 --> 00:19:16,280
Come on.
-Oh, my gram!

408
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:19,690
Go faster! Go, go, go, go, go,
go, go, go, go, go, go!

409
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:22,660
Oh! Oh, oh!
This is troubling! Oh, no!

410
00:19:22,690 --> 00:19:26,560
No! Oh! Oh!

411
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:28,530
-He won't make it in time.
-Yes, he will.

412
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:31,830
Sorry, Quinn.
We wait for Gary.

413
00:19:31,870 --> 00:19:35,340
All right.
We wait for Gary.

414
00:19:35,370 --> 00:19:37,870
Man #3: Galaxy I,
prepare to be boarded.

415
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:45,580
Open the freaking door!

416
00:19:45,610 --> 00:19:55,460
♪♪

417
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,470
Lightfold the ship,
H.U.E.!

418
00:20:19,410 --> 00:20:22,420
It works.

419
00:20:22,450 --> 00:20:23,890
Dad, these are
my coordinates.

420
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,720
Come find me, I mean,
at your leisure,

421
00:20:25,750 --> 00:20:27,790
but, like, for me,
preferably fast.

422
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:29,420
That'd be great.

423
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:30,930
Dad, these are my coordinates.

424
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,730
Come find me, I mean,
at your leisure,

425
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:34,730
but, like, for me,
preferably fast.

426
00:20:34,760 --> 00:20:37,400
That'd be great.

427
00:20:40,540 --> 00:20:42,570
Who reverse-hacked H.U.E.
and the Sames again?

428
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:45,340
-I did.
-Right, you keep saying that,

429
00:20:45,370 --> 00:20:47,480
except there's just no
way that's possible.

430
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:49,610
Oh, yeah.
He's truthin' it.

431
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:51,450
So what can you tell me about
this gravitational disturbance?

432
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,980
Why do you
want to know?

433
00:20:53,010 --> 00:20:53,850
I think my dad has
something to do with it.

434
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:57,290
-Wait, who's your dad?
-John Goodspeed.

435
00:20:57,320 --> 00:21:01,060
Your dad was John Goodspeed?
Now I remember!

436
00:21:01,090 --> 00:21:02,990
Five years ago,
you're the guy

437
00:21:03,020 --> 00:21:05,060
who kept asking me
for a drink,

438
00:21:05,090 --> 00:21:06,990
then blew up 92
Imperium Cruisers

439
00:21:07,030 --> 00:21:08,760
and a small Mexican
family restaurant!

440
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:12,430
Yes, yes, yes! That's me!
You do remember me!

441
00:21:12,470 --> 00:21:13,570
I do.

442
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:16,070
Now get that finger out of my
face, or I'll snap it off.

443
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:18,770
I like
how you speak words.

444
00:21:18,810 --> 00:21:21,040
[ Finger snaps ]
Aah!
